# The black-box suite is a byte-level oracle and its runner is bash: on a
# core.autocrlf=true checkout every multi-line .out sidecar gains \r and the
# whole suite false-fails (observed: 270 spurious failures on a fresh
# worktree of an otherwise-green commit).  Pin LF for the suite, its inputs
# and sidecars, and for shell scripts generally.
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.dpm text eol=lf
blackbox/cases/** text eol=lf
